# HR Local Lock — freeze

HR Local Lock parity with Employee Auth Wave 2 Phases 0–5 is **accepted and frozen**.
Do **not** merge sessions, start Phase 6, or reuse employee SecureStore keys.

Canonical debt: `ops/HR_MOBILE_LOCAL_LOCK_CONTRACT_DEBT.md`

## Frozen product shape

- Separate operator AuthProvider + `wathefni.hr.*` tokens + `/dashboard/mobile/auth/*`
- Namespaced PIN/bio/autolock material bound to `company_code:user_id`
- Shared UX: PinFlows, UnlockWithBiometricGate (injected HR attempt), cream overlay/privacy cover
- Recovery = operator email/password re-auth (not employee OTP)
- `HRLocalUnlockShell` mounted only in HR mode
- Independent Employee ↔ HR unlock state
- Device Security on HR Settings; no Phase 6

## Allowed without owner change-control

- Bugfixes restoring isolation / seal / has_task-style lock invariants
- Docs / canary log / debt notes
- Shared UI primitive fixes that do not cross principal stores

## Not allowed without an explicit owner wave

- Unifying employee/operator sessions or SecureStore keys
- Binding HR PIN to `employee_key`
- Phase 6 / device screen-lock trust work
- HR push registration on `/app/push`
